# Live check of the written summaries with the real text model (Nova Lite), prompt summary-v2 of pull request 79.
# Date: 2026-11-22. Context: 20 real candidates per run taken from the stored result of a real job (strong, good and weak bands), their fragments from the index, a real Fit call for the reason, ToR 01. Bedrock Converse in us-east-1.
# Runs 9 and 10 used the prompt before the must haves rule, runs m1 and m2 the final prompt of pull request 79, runs k1 and k2 the prompt of pull request 78 (the same script with that version imported, and the first reply analysed with the same rules), runs c1 and c2 a combination of both that was not kept.
# The first three summaries of each run are printed in full. A summary is accepted when it has 40 to 60 words, names no other band, has no dash used as punctuation and no list.

