### P3 Together
Runs 9 and 10: 38 of 40 summaries accepted (95 percent), 33 at the first try and 5 after a retry, 2 fell back to the template. Accepted summaries have 43 to 60 words, 52.6 on average. Summary tokens of the 40 summaries, every try: 40246 in and 2815 out, about 0.00008 USD a summary (computed with the prices of cost-measurement.log).
RESULT: In production, summary-v1 of pull request 60 had 0 of 25 summaries accepted in the five real jobs (job-records.log P1). Earlier runs of the prompt while it was being tuned are not kept as logs: asking for about 45 words gave 9 of 20, and two or three sentences with one retry gave 17 to 19 of 20.

